      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GREAT CHAT (7) charged out of the boxes with a fast early split and led throughout to score when a 4 length winner (29.75) over 520m at this track. Ran one of the fastest times on the program in his latest win. Great chance to get the job done again. STRIP WEATHERS (1) had to overcome a collision with another runner and could manage only a distant sixth (35.35) in a OPEN over 601m at this track. Has the ability and can atone with the right run. TIC TAC MONELLI (2) trailed the lead and fought on well to be beaten 6 lengths into third (30.21) at this track in a Grade 5 over 520m. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings three times from six starts. Will give a great sight again. ZAMBORA BLISS (4) boasts a solid strike-rate over this trip.",
